{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_010azu0253_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_010azu0253_1000_p", "source_sha256": "3738d4861bbd64ba04f3b7a8e0141ced26aa47f7c25087d5691f0fa41482fd1d", "ja": "（CLEVER CLOVERの最初の公演が終わり、\n書類仕事をしている。ふう……目がチカチカするな）", "zh": "（CLEVER CLOVER的首场公演结束了，\n现在正在处理文件。呼……眼睛都看花了）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_010azu0253_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_010azu0253_1001_010azu", "source_sha256": "68278078232d694bf95e0080a8c2339dbd9703ffb17edfa92969c839e68b0816", "ja": "{$P$}さん、お疲れさまです。", "zh": "{$P$}先生，你辛苦了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_010azu0253_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_010azu0253_1002_010azu", "source_sha256": "62af6950d789745604b26275da906fd5d7f2a42399a4244c3b87d75b54b07ccb", "ja": "あの……何か、\nお手伝いできることはありませんか？", "zh": "那个……有什么，\n我可以帮忙的吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_010azu0253_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_010azu0253_1003_p", "source_sha256": "39ffc36f836728abcb54080f11c3a7f576aea8f42807b4236d975506f3e9f7b1", "ja": "お疲れさまです、あずささん。\nえーっと……多分、大丈夫ですけど。", "zh": "辛苦了，梓小姐。\n呃……应该没什么问题。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_010azu0253_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_010azu0253_1004_010azu", "source_sha256": "e8ea62e662e846ec6d7d3f5edde4bd87b707e7530e29ae5407f86093608ce152", "ja": "そうですか……。\nあの、なにかあれば遠慮せず仰ってくださいね。", "zh": "这样啊……\n那个，要是有什么事，请别客气，尽管告诉我哦。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_010azu0253_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_010azu0253_1005_p", "source_sha256": "b017f10c6eb2fb4b122ca7f27f3fe45877f7721ec18ebbaa78d4616fba16b41b", "ja": "ありがとうございます。……というか、\nあずささん、何か用事があったんじゃないですか？", "zh": "谢谢。……话说回来，\nあずさ小姐，您不是还有什么事吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_010azu0253_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_010azu0253_1006_010azu", "source_sha256": "317e7c24b47ded6d0191ea6dec5a2afa161b9044fe0e9404e171a2f66838a5f1", "ja": "あ、あら……うふふ。さすが\n{$P$}さん。お見通しですね。", "zh": "啊、哎呀……呵呵。不愧是\n{$P$}先生，什么都瞒不过您呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_010azu0253_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_010azu0253_1007_010azu", "source_sha256": "24af3e7662fc152c7db03ca633ce7de718f54546ae1d8e9832c9b0db68213d1b", "ja": "相談というほどのことではないんですけど……。\n今回の公演で、私、ふがいなさを感じてしまって。", "zh": "虽然还没到要商量的程度……但在这次公演中，我觉得自己实在太没用了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_010azu0253_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_010azu0253_1008_p", "source_sha256": "d758473e6a1ebb4d20b12d160c54d50a2a59a03f5052fcff9e59bef2ffe3ec96", "ja": "ふがいなさ？　どうしてまた……。", "zh": "没用感？怎么又……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_010azu0253_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_010azu0253_1009_010azu", "source_sha256": "9021fa69274f81fdbed1e20be1ad86b976742f512d6a895ad7307ae42802cbee", "ja": "私は他のみんなより、年上ですから。\n支えてあげなくちゃって思ってたんですけど……。", "zh": "因为我比其他人年长，所以一直想着一定要支持大家……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_010azu0253_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_010azu0253_1010_010azu", "source_sha256": "2035255f5b73e18e6204b84eeba82654488db5ff4d89558699bef29fa0d14807", "ja": "みんなを支えるどころか、\n逆に気をつかわせてしまったみたいで……。", "zh": "别说是支持大家了，反而好像让大家为我操心了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_010azu0253_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_010azu0253_1011_p", "source_sha256": "d397e5597ca5adad5784eb6301185b2fc2b51a8a37f2f592b27fb15e4a5d3ddc", "ja": "そうですか……。でも俺は、あずささんに\n参加してもらえて、良かったと思ってますよ。", "zh": "这样啊……不过我觉得，能请あずさ小姐参加，真的太好了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_010azu0253_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_010azu0253_1012_010azu", "source_sha256": "c2280d091343f277773bf45d966ec6f7e65c43dec0ab66c52007ddf13934c7d7", "ja": "けど私、{$P$}さんに\nそう言ってもらえるようなことは、何も……。", "zh": "可是我，并没有做什么值得让{$P$}先生这样对我说的事……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_010azu0253_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_010azu0253_1013_p", "source_sha256": "05e6f6776d9556569418f8f3ee4809e23acc4e879cec404cb2f02035dd8bb516", "ja": "今回、海美やロコはなんとなくテーマを掴めた\nみたいですけど、星梨花は違いましたから。", "zh": "这次，海美和ROCO好像都隐约抓住了主题，不过星梨花就不一样了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_010azu0253_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_010azu0253_1014_p", "source_sha256": "2200d62d7c550bed69d966e13b4b652799a83011b129ccb3821fad83c1418966", "ja": "一緒に悩んでくれるあずささんがいてくれて、\nよかったと思います。", "zh": "有亚美陪我一起烦恼，我觉得真是太好了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_010azu0253_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_010azu0253_1015_010azu", "source_sha256": "ae5e7dfee00ce29f31ee310ac9059b564fd8b12f60f6d6ef58ca8d16267842a7", "ja": "あっ……。\nふふっ。たしかに、それはそうでしたね。", "zh": "啊……  \n呵呵。确实，的确是这样呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_010azu0253_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_010azu0253_1016_p", "source_sha256": "a92b34efab30794b7297c8bd6c3f3eac46a485f8efa5087d54a04978420148a7", "ja": "はい。ふたりが悩んで掴んだものは、\nお客さんにもきっと、伝わると思います。", "zh": "是的。我想，两个人烦恼后领悟到的东西，一定也能传达给客人。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_010azu0253_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_010azu0253_1017_010azu", "source_sha256": "a0cc73f1d144950b406ac5c2e8e5fdf1d663eb97f256297461385463c89bfad9", "ja": "{$P$}さん……\nありがとうございます。", "zh": "{$P$}先生……\n谢谢你。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_010azu0253_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_010azu0253_1018_010azu", "source_sha256": "86184b2250b9ff00f009061364a4462741db6a28f50abf70ce17330ce61872a1", "ja": "私にも、しっかりと役割があったんですね。\nCLEVER CLOVERのひとりとして。", "zh": "原来我也确实有着属于自己的重要职责呢。作为CLEVER CLOVER的一员。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_010azu0253_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_010azu0253_1019_p", "source_sha256": "335b62a687fd1c3a939c1196dbcdd5cdbd097312aeebec953d8bb94b4da72a20", "ja": "もちろん！　ツアーはまだまだ、これからです。\n忙しくなりますよ！", "zh": "当然！巡演才刚刚开始。\n接下来会变得很忙哦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_010azu0253_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_010azu0253_1020_010azu", "source_sha256": "afd29073cdaa8df66d8bc13905ce3d06022033dbef380d49a42ba8e26ecb9eae", "ja": "はい、頑張ります♪　けど、私がまた\n何かに迷うことがあったら……。", "zh": "好的，我会努力的♪不过，如果我又有什么烦恼的话……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_010azu0253_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_010azu0253_1021_010azu", "source_sha256": "546f3b8db9937a3362cb82991d217bb2f23a064abc75f0dca8fc676f350aa9a9", "ja": "その時は……{$P$}さんに、\n導いてもらってもいいですか？", "zh": "到那时……可以请{$P$}先生为我指引吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_010azu0253_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_010azu0253_1022_p", "source_sha256": "567a9be9a5f37b95dfce876ec864193139b890bd5653daa2bdc0e042138ecac3", "ja": "もちろんです！\nあずささんがどこにいても、必ず迎えに行きますよ。", "zh": "当然了！\n无论梓小姐在哪里，我都一定会去接你的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_010azu0253_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_010azu0253_1023_010azu", "source_sha256": "291f86d691122a2f43b9cc3910e822606d6098de867556c97ae1d6a887906a6d", "ja": "うふふ、ありがとうございます。\nこれで私、安心して冒険できますね。", "zh": "呜呼呼，谢谢您。\n这样一来，我就能放心地去冒险了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_010azu0253_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_010azu0253_1024_010azu", "source_sha256": "54945b9ba4cfb3f527c8f0e7b1530c5afceacd5978c0fbc957a3fc4999249f77", "ja": "悩んだり、迷ったりしながら……\n色々なこと、たくさん経験しようと思います♪", "zh": "虽然会有烦恼，也会有迷茫……\n但我想去经历各种各样的事情♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
